about: >-
  <p>The course covers the history and properties of basic AI systems — neural networks, machine learning, and data
  science — and how to build an AI project end to end, from collecting and processing data to training and deploying a
  model. Applications include computer vision, natural language processing, recommendation systems, and games, and we
  discuss bias, security, privacy, explainability, and ethics along the way. A primer on Python supports the homework
  and a group project.</p>
